      "stem": "A 4-month-old has paroxysms of coughing followed by an inspiratory 'whoop' and post-tussive vomiting after 2 weeks of mild rhinorrhea. CBC shows marked lymphocytosis (WBC 32,000/μL, 80% lymphocytes). What is the mechanism of the main toxin?",
