      "stem": "A 60-year-old man from Jamaica starts high-dose prednisone for a COPD exacerbation. Two weeks later he develops diffuse abdominal pain, respiratory failure, a serpiginous periumbilical rash, and E. coli bacteremia with meningitis. Stool and sputum show the larvae pictured. Which feature of this parasite explains his condition?",
